# UI & product tone

## Brand

- Logo: `logo-mark` / Fugaz One; teal `#0f766e` (light) / brighter on dark
- Body: Plus Jakarta Sans (self-hosted `public/fonts/` + `src/lib/fonts.css`); CSS vars in `src/index.css` (`--bg`, `--surface`, `--logo`, `--partner-a/b/common/other`). Do not reintroduce Google Fonts `@import` (causes logo FOUT).
- Theme: class `.dark` on `html` + `@custom-variant dark` in `index.css` (not `prefers-color-scheme`). Muted copy: `text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400`. Charts: `axisTick` / `legendLabel` / `tipProps` from `chart-theme.ts`; dark tooltips also forced via `.recharts-default-tooltip` in `index.css`.
- Partner identity: blue A / rose B / violet common / amber other (not brand teal) — `src/lib/partners.ts` + `OwnerBadge`
- Boot/setup/lock share `AuthShell` + `.logo-mark-on-light` (no flat `--bg` splash — avoids flash)

Tone: private couple’s OS — not bank SaaS. Sync = “vault / GitHub”, not “our cloud.”
Never show formula letters (X / Y / Z) in UI copy — use plain words (income, expenses, left after expenses, pocket).

## Dates & money

- UI dates: **DD/MM/YYYY** via `src/lib/dates.ts`
- Month labels: **MM/YYYY**
- Money: always euro — `formatMoney` / `MoneyInput` / `parseLocaleNumber` (no currency Settings)

## Structure

- Primitives: `src/components/ui/*`
- Nav: Home, Track, History, Incomes, Expenses, Outlook (text); Settings as header icon with sync/theme/lock
- Logo **Tandem** → Home (`/`); Home also first nav tab. Track at `/track`
- Page titles: shared sticky `PageHeader` (`layout/PageHeader.tsx`) under the app nav for Home, Track (hub + editor), History / Incomes / Expenses / Outlook — same band and type; analytics wraps it with the range toggle. Soft-load header with `fadeIn` (opacity only); put `fadeUp` on body content only so sticky range/header keeps working. Do not use negative horizontal margins for full-bleed bands; keep shell `overflow-x-clip` + `min-w-0` on main/scrollers
- Type hierarchy: **Page** `PageHeader` → **Section** `SectionHeading` / `CardTitle` (sentence case, display weight) → **Meta** `MetaLabel` / table th / form Label (tiny uppercase only). Never use MetaLabel styling for major section titles (Outlook Looking ahead, Track hub, MonthEditor Incomes/Expenses/Notes, etc.)
- Track (`/track`) = hub + inline month editor (`MonthEditor`); month list = month · fixed-width left-aligned In/Out/Left (label over amount; negative Left uses Outlook pocket orange) · pencil · delete. Editor sticky footer = three equal metric parts (Household · partner A · partner B); split toggle on the Cancel/Save row; avoid “Pocket” on this strip. Keep editor bottom padding ≥ footer height so Expenses **Add to month** is not covered; Save flushes pending card-sheet amounts.
- Home = horizontal snap scroller (all tracked months + next estimate); thumb-drag follows the strip then smooth-settles; leftover + partner **Keeps** use Outlook orange when negative; partner **Income** + **Pays** + **Keeps** on cards; settle line when card payment data exists; no Track/History/Outlook CTAs on Home (empty vault still offers track / samples)
- Track hub list: calendar month in teal (no “current” label)
- Track footer: Pays = fair share of bills (not card charge); settlement line when `paymentByOwner` has data
- Settings uses sticky sub-tabs: Household / Categories / Banks / Vault / Security (auto-lock + password) / Data; keep short plain-English helper notes on confusing controls
- Track editor sections: **Incomes**, **Expenses** (card chips + shared bank labels + month totals), optional **Notes**
- History = charts over tracked months (varied series hues, not all teal); Outlook = hero Σ leftover + month leftover bars; looking-ahead Income / Expenses €/% / Pocket €/%; Pocket in teal; no separate Savings tile; don’t repeat avg as “next €same” hints; no expenses-vs-pocket strip bar; no multi-month projection table (baseline tiles are enough)
- Chart legends: click toggles series visibility (`useLegendFilter`); dim/strike hidden labels; reset when range changes
- Pie charts: `PieBreakdown` (donut left, €/% rows fill remaining width; two columns when ≥5 slices); same card layout on History + Expenses mix; do not rely on Recharts Legend for pie filter (shared `dataKey: "value"`)
- Expenses table: category rows × month columns (not the reverse)
- History/Incomes/Expenses/Outlook range toggle sticks under the app header while scrolling (`PageHeader` + `overflow-x: clip`)
- Prefer existing Button/Card/Input/Select patterns and stone/teal Tailwind usage
- Dropdowns: always `Select` from `src/components/ui/select.tsx` (appearance-none + inset ChevronDown) — no raw browser `<select>`
- Clickable controls: `cursor-pointer` on hover (Button base + nav / raw `<button>`s)
- Motion: subtle (`fadeIn` on sticky headers, `fadeUp` on page body) — not noisy

## Shortcuts (preserve)

- `Ctrl/Cmd+N` start tracking current month and open `/track` · `Ctrl/Cmd+S` save month or push
